• **JSON contract**: `{key_claims, key_quotes, relevance, confidence, source_type, deeper_question} for extraction; {answer, consensus, disagreements, gaps, confidence, source_count}` for synthesis
• **Chunking**: sources >30KB split at ~25KB paragraph boundaries
• Fallback: malformed JSON → partial summary; empty/errored → direct `curl | head` with low-confidence result
• Depth cap: 3 (matching analyze-trajectory's pattern)
• Relationship table: clear routing between research and synthesis based on source count and size

